@title Cooling advice sizes its fans from the project's fan parts and names the article
@area Heat
# The hot cabinet with four fan parts in the catalog (two share 300 m3/h). The sweep's fan sizes are those four, each fan option names its article (equal flows both named) and the footer says where the sizes come from.
open qa/fixtures/cabinet-cooling-fans.novo
wait 30
click_text Cabinet #1
wait 30
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text Show or hide heat
wait 6
key Enter
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text Cooling advice
wait 8
expect "Cooling advice and vent sweep"
key Enter
wait 20
wait_s 90
expect "Cooling advice"
expect "Model estimate"
expect "Fan: QA"
expect "Fan sizes come from your parts and cooling list"
shot advice-fans
check_layout
